6. **靴子**：展示成对靴子，强调鞋底、绑带、金属包边或毛绒内衬等细节。\n7. **手套/护手**：展示一对手套或护手甲，突出手背装甲、指节结构与袖口过渡。\n8. **披风/斗篷**：展示披风整体展开或垂挂状态，体现布料垂坠感、边缘装饰与背部连接点。\n9. **武器**：展示武器完整形态，可为单手/双手武器，突出材质、锋刃、握把与装饰细节。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "NPC提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [1966.3990190294053, -314.78281317816845], "scale": 0.45}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "带参考图", "bounding": [659.5916137695312, 694.3004150390625, 1783.6015625, 707.4249267578125]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "从角色、scaffold生成NPC九宫格提示词", "bounding": [656.82666015625, -874.7863159179688, 1953.4371337890625, 1057.583984375]}], "links": [[5, 6, 0, 7, 12, "STRING"], [6, 7, 1, 8, 0, "*"], [7, 7, 0, 9, 0, "*"], [13, 14, 0, 10, 11, "STRING"], [21, 24, 0, 25, 0, "IMAGE"], [23, 10, 0, 24, 0, "IMAGE"], [25, 10, 0, 28, 0, "IMAGE"], [29, 13, 0, 10, 0, "IMAGE"]], "id": "ed38814a-1697-4f41-9307-821696e51ee8", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 42, "revision": 0}